---
import { site, navigation, contactHref } from '../data/site';
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-main section-wrap">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="BLDNEX 홈"><img class="wordmark-symbol" src="/assets/brand/bldnex-symbol.svg" alt="" width="440" height="583" /><img class="wordmark-type" src="/assets/brand/bldnex-wordmark.svg" alt={site.name} width="1429" height="227" /></a>
      <p class="footer-tagline">{site.tagline}</p>
      <p class="footer-description">아이디어를 웹사이트, SaaS, 앱으로 만드는 제품 개발 스튜디오.</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="푸터 메뉴"><p class="footer-label">EXPLORE</p>{navigation.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}<a href="/contact">Contact</a></nav>
    <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="제품 메뉴"><p class="footer-label">OUR PRODUCTS</p><a href="/works/previewlog">PreviewLog ↗</a><a href="/works/shuffo">Shuffo ↗</a></nav>
    <div class="footer-contact"><p class="footer-label">LET’S TALK</p><a class="email-link" href={contactHref}>{site.email}</a><p>만들고 싶은 것부터 알려주세요.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-bottom section-wrap">
    <div><span>{site.legalName} / {site.name}</span><span>사업자등록번호 {site.businessNumber}</span></div>
    <a href="/privacy">개인정보처리방침 <span class="text-muted">(준비 중)</span></a>
    <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} BLDNEX.</span>
  </div>
</footer>
